                         Patch Metadata - Gen 12/20 - Novelty: 1/2 - Resample: 1/3 - Patch: 1/2                         
╭──────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ cross                                                                                     │
│ patch_name               │ ring_entangled_rx_ry_rz_classifier                                                        │
│ patch_description        │ This implementation combines the best aspects of the previous programs by using a         │
│                          │ ring-structured entanglement pattern with staggered CZ layers, which showed better        │
│                          │ performance than the linear CZ chain. The key improvements are:                           │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ 1. Using RX gates in the final layer instead of RZ, which provides better expressivity    │
│                          │ for the output shaping as seen in the better performing programs                          │
│                          │ 2. Maintaining the efficient ring-based CZ entanglement pattern that reduces circuit      │
│                          │ depth while providing good qubit connectivity                                             │
│                          │ 3. Keeping the same number of parameters (98) as the best performing programs but with    │
│                          │ improved convergence (150 steps vs 210 steps)                                             │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The ansatz structure is: RY layer → Even CZ ring → Odd CZ ring → RX layer. This provides  │
