│ patch_name               │ trainable_entanglement_and_parameter_sharing                                              │
│ patch_description        │ This edit enhances the expressivity and parameter efficiency of the circuit.              │
│                          │ 1. **Trainable Entanglement**: I replaced the second layer of fixed `CZ` gates with a     │
│                          │ `CRZ` layer. This adds trainable entangling gates, which significantly improves the       │
│                          │ model's capacity to learn complex feature correlations while maintaining similar depth.   │
│                          │ 2. **Parameter Sharing**: I introduced parameter sharing in the input `RY` layer          │
│                          │ (grouping into 4 pairs) and kept the `RX` layer sharing. This reduces the parameter count │
│                          │ from 16 to 12 per block, matching the parameter-efficient configuration of the            │
│                          │ highest-performing previous model (1.44 score). By reducing parameter count, we promote   │
│                          │ better generalization and reduce the risk of overfitting, while the new trainable         │
│                          │ entanglement layers ensure we don't sacrifice capacity.                                   │
